\begin_layout Plain Layout
We can evaluate the inner products as follows:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\braket{0|1}=\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{c}
0\\
1
\end{array}\right]=1\cdot0+0\cdot1=0
\]

\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\braket{1|0}=\left[\begin{array}{cc}
0 & 1\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{c}
1\\
0
\end{array}\right]=0\cdot1+1\cdot0=0
\]

\end_inset

In this case,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\braket{0|1}=\braket{1|0}=0$
\end_inset

.
